  "id": "2026-09-depreciation-rate-restatement",
  "description": "Restates July and August 2026 depreciation/amortisation onto the basis that governed Oct 2025 - Jun 2026. The 8 September rebuild recreated the lost depreciation schedules from category defaults (20%/40% declining balance, software 33.33% straight line) instead of the rates already in force (10%/20% straight line, software 5%), and the earlier correction package posted July and August on those defaults - overstating the charge by 822,102.07 across the two months. This removes those 26 entries by exact id and resets each schedule to its 30 June basis and book value; the app's own month-end posting then reposts July and August at the correct rates, through the normal path with its duplicate guard, rather than this migration adding entries itself.",
